-sensitive materials; reflective films for traffic and safety applications; and pressure-sensitive vinyl and specialty materials for digital imaging, screen printing, and sign cutting applications under the Avery Dennison and Mactac brand names. In addition, it offers branding solutions, which include brand embellishments, graphic tickets, tags, labels, and sustainable packaging; information solutions, such as item-level RFID, visibility and loss prevention, price ticketing and marking, productivity and media, and brand protection and security solutions; and shelf-edge productivity and media solutions under the Vestcom brand names, as well as care, content, and country of origin compliance solutions. It serves home and personal care, apparel, general retail, e-commerce, logistics, food and grocery, pharmaceuticals, and automotive industries. The company was formerly known as Avery International Corporation and changed its name to Avery Dennison Corporation in 1990. The company was founded in 1935 and is headquartered in Mentor, Ohio.","employees":35000,"website":"https://www.averydennison.com","country":"United States","city":"Mentor","officers":[{"name":"Mr. Deon M. Stander","title":"President, CEO & Director"},{"name":"Mr. Gregory S. Lovins","title":"CFO, Senior VP & Principal Financial Officer"}]},"sector_medians":{"fpe":16.45,"tpe":19.93,"ps":2.008,"pfcf":27.35,"peg":1.45,"pb":6.316,"rev_growth":0.057,"eps_growth":0.108,"eps_growth_fwd":0.0761,"eps_growth_next":0.105,"div_yield":0.012,"roe":0.309,"roa":0.08208,"de":110.9,"gross_margin":0.431,"op_margin":0.1359,"profit_margin":0.0934,"current_ratio":1.111},"valuation":[{"k":"fpe","label":"Forward P/E","v":16.26,"sector":16.45,"score":0,"verdict":"Fairly valued"},{"k":"tpe","label":"TTM P/E","v":19.92,"sector":19.93,"score":0,"verdict":"Fairly valued"},{"k":"ps","label":"Price / Sales","v":1.504,"sector":2.008,"score":1,"verdict":"Undervalued"},{"k":"pfcf","label":"Price / FCF","v":13.84,"sector":27.35,"score":1,"